        "Exact wording and date of the March 2026 Discover Bradenton grand-opening article (page now redirects; the \"Village Home\"/\"Row Home\" labels are unverified).",
        "Titles of sales consultants Alexa Curbelo and Ashley See; Sarasota Design Studio address.",
